## First week of real usage

**Watch it the same way you watched the original workflow.** The tells that identified the opportunity will also tell you where the new system is failing people.

| Observation | Tell | What it indicates | Action taken |
|---|---|---|---|

<!-- table:adoption.resistance role=register id=Who -->

## Resistance

**Treat resistance as information rather than obstruction.** When someone insists a system does not work and cannot articulate why, **go and watch them use it** — there is almost always a real requirement underneath that nobody thought to ask about.

| Who (role) | What they said | What watching revealed | Real requirement underneath | Resolved? |
|---|---|---|---|---|

